<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<title>技術決策完整分析報告</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 15mm; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: 'NotoSansTC', 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif;
    color: #1f2d3d;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 22px; color: #1f4d47; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .meta { font-size: 11px; color: #5b7890; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  h2 {
    font-size: 15px; color: #2b5876;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #dfe9f3;
    padding-bottom: 4px; margin: 20px 0 10px;
    break-after: avoid;
  }

  .mode-summary {
    background: #f7fbff;
    border: 1px solid #dbe8f3;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .mode-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(122,206,255,0.4), rgba(178,149,255,0.38));
    color: #0f4f9f;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-right: 8px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .steps-text { font-size: 12px; color: #496b79; margin: 6px 0 0; }
  .mode-summary-text { margin: 6px 0 0; color: #496b79; }

  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; }
  .summary-table th { width: 130px; }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #dbe8f3;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    word-break: break-word;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  th { background: #f5f9fc; color: #355b78; }

  .vendor-card {
    border: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .vendor-card .tag-row .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 2px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-right: 6px;
  }
  .badge.category { background: #e8f4ff; color: #1a73e8; }
  .badge.reuse { background: #e8fff0; color: #1aaa5c; }
  .vendor-card h3 { font-size: 14px; margin: 6px 0; color: #1a1a1a; }
  .vendor-meta-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 4px 12px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .vendor-meta-grid .item .label { font-size: 10px; color: #26a69a; font-weight: 700; }
  .vendor-meta-grid .item .value { font-size: 11px; color: #333; margin-top: 2px; }
  .reason-tags .tag {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 2px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #faedb5;
    color: #c78305;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 4px 4px 0;
  }

  .internal-note {
    background: #fdf6e3;
    border: 1px dashed #e0c46c;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #7a6117;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .empty-hint { font-size: 12px; color: #999; padding: 10px 0; }
  .footer-note { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 10px; color: #999; text-align: right; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>技術決策完整分析報告</h1>
  <p class="meta">匯出時間：{{exportTime}}</p>

  <h2>推薦循環模式</h2>
  <div class="mode-summary">
    <span class="mode-badge">{{mode.modeName}}</span>
    <strong>{{mode.title}}</strong>
    <p class="steps-text">{{mode.stepsText}}</p>
    {{#if mode.summary}}
      <p class="mode-summary-text">{{mode.summary}}</p>
    {{/if}}
  </div>

  <h2>決策需求摘要</h2>
  {{#if demandSummary.length}}
    <table class="summary-table">
      <tbody>
        {{#each demandSummary}}
          <tr><th>{{this.label}}</th><td>{{this.value}}</td></tr>
        {{/each}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  {{else}}
    <p class="empty-hint">無可匯出資料</p>
  {{/if}}

  <h2>{{#if isInternalMode}}廠內自行執行{{else}}執行方式與技術廠商{{/if}}</h2>
  {{#if isInternalMode}}
    <div class="internal-note">
      此循環模式由產源事業於廠內自行執行，無須尋找外部技術廠商。
    </div>
  {{else}}
    {{#if vendors.length}}
      {{#each vendors}}
        <div class="vendor-card">
          <div class="tag-row">
            <span class="badge category">{{this.announcement_category_name}}</span>
            {{#if this.showReuseTag}}
              <span class="badge reuse">再利用機構</span>
            {{/if}}
          </div>
          <h3>{{this.company_name}}</h3>
          <div class="vendor-meta-grid">
            <div class="item"><div class="label">再利用廢棄物</div><div class="value">{{this.waste_name}}</div></div>
            <div class="item"><div class="label">所在地</div><div class="value">{{this.region}}</div></div>
            <div class="item"><div class="label">距離</div><div class="value">{{this.road_distance_km}} km</div></div>
            <div class="item"><div class="label">許可總量</div><div class="value">{{this.permitted_quantity}} 噸/月</div></div>
            <div class="item"><div class="label">前月收受總量</div><div class="value">{{this.capacityLevelText}}</div></div>
            <div class="item"><div class="label">事業管制編號</div><div class="value">{{this.control_number}}</div></div>
            <div class="item"><div class="label">有效許可期限</div><div class="value">{{this.permit_end_date}}</div></div>
          </div>
          {{#if this.conditional_judgment.length}}
            <div class="reason-tags">
              {{#each this.conditional_judgment}}
                <span class="tag">{{this}}</span>
              {{/each}}
            </div>
          {{/if}}
        </div>
      {{/each}}
    {{else}}
      <p class="empty-hint">目前無廠商資料</p>
    {{/if}}
  {{/if}}

  <p class="footer-note">本報告由系統自動產出，僅供決策參考，實際合作仍應依相關條件評估。</p>
</body>
</html>
